      "description": "<h2>Updates:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated to support SPT v3.11</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Notes:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This version should be compatible with any SPT v3.11 release.</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1509-color-converter-api/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Color Converter API</a> enables darker background shades for higher penetration ammunition.</li>\n<li>The configuration file is in <strong>JSON5</strong> format. The file extension is not a mistake. <em><strong>Do not rename it!</strong></em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Issues?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>If you experience any problems, please <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/refringe/EasyAmmunition/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">submit a detailed bug report.</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>♥</p>\n",
